# Lens output — reports and raw ranked data are about *your* codebase.
# They are working artifacts, not source, and they routinely name internal
# services, routes and file paths. Keep them out of version control by default;
# a security lens report in particular is a map of your own soft spots.
REPORT-*.md
TARGETS*.md
TRIAGE-*.md
data-*.json
candidates.json

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
